{"id":"c2a8f862c318be2c","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-theorem.md","title":"GL Theorem","display":"df-gl-theorem — GL Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-theorem","aliases":["89-df-gl-theorem"],"display":"df-gl-theorem — GL Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-derivable]]","[[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-theorem — GL Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65efb02e976f40b6\" href=\"?note=65efb02e976f40b6\" title=\"89-df-gl-derivable\">89-df-gl-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b560939370c68b68\" href=\"?note=b560939370c68b68\" title=\"89-lem-gl-proof-closure\">89-lem-gl-proof-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65efb02e976f40b6\" href=\"?note=65efb02e976f40b6\" title=\"89-df-gl-derivable\">89-df-gl-derivable</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L},\n\\qquad\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\quad\n(\\mathrm{Thm}_{G\\!L}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L},\n\\qquad\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\quad\n(\\mathrm{Thm}_{G\\!L}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL定理是 GL 的可推导公式</li>\n<li>GL定理是 GL 的核心概念</li>\n<li>GL定理与可证明性相关</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：Boolos 第 1 章 pp.4–6。由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b560939370c68b68\" href=\"?note=b560939370c68b68\" title=\"89-lem-gl-proof-closure\">89-lem-gl-proof-closure</a>，本条有限推导定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}=\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}=\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}\\)</span> 恰等于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a> 的交集闭包 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>。后续在两个记号之间换用时使用这一已证明等式，不以标题“GL”替代接口等价的证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-derivable","status":"resolved","id":"65efb02e976f40b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-derivable]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-proof-closure","status":"resolved","id":"b560939370c68b68","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-derivable","status":"resolved","id":"65efb02e976f40b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-gl-derivable]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-proof-closure","status":"resolved","id":"b560939370c68b68","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos 第 1 章 pp.4–6。由 [[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]]，本条有限推导定义的 $\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}=\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}$ 恰等于 [[89-df-gl-logic]] 的交集闭包 $\\mathrm{GL}$。后续在两个记号之间换用时使用这一已证明等式，不以标题“GL”替代接口等价的证明。","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos 第 1 章 pp.4–6。由 [[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]]，本条有限推导定义的 $\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}=\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}$ 恰等于 [[89-df-gl-logic]] 的交集闭包 $\\mathrm{GL}$。后续在两个记号之间换用时使用这一已证明等式，不以标题“GL”替代接口等价的证明。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{D}_{G\\!L},\n\\qquad\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\quad\n(\\mathrm{Thm}_{G\\!L}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}=\\mathcal D_{G\\!L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false}],"bytes":1039,"backlinks":[{"id":"128a3cd6545693f6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e3c2e4c6dd0d4529","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-gl-theorem]])."},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限证明与闭包：[[89-df-gl-proof-system]] → [[89-df-gl-derivable]] → [[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]] → [[89-df-gl-theorem]]。"}],"outgoing":["65efb02e976f40b6","b560939370c68b68","0006800fa1c85177"]}